[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0010","text":"────雾子……！\n雾子，太棒了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0020","text":"那个……好的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0030","text":"因为……\n大家帮了我……好多好多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0040","text":"这件……衣服也是……\n造型师也是……制作人也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0050","text":"还有被我吓到的……\n粉丝们也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0060","text":"……雾子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0070","text":"所以……\n如果做到了……我会很开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0080","text":"大大的……恶作剧──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0090","text":"大成功哦\n看，哈哈。能听到温柔又有精神的尖叫声────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0095","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0100","text":"────安可，去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_03_0105","text":"Motion"}]
